    "detailed_description": "Tired of challenge, rushing, and competition? <br>We don't have it!!! The cute little snail will take you to a world of relaxation, positive vibes, and only good news ^_^. <br>Read inspiring little stories about High Smileson and find his friend - High Snailson in every picture. <br><strong>This game is about finding yourself, your inner peace, and enjoying small simple moments in life.</strong><br><br>A world created from the works of the popular Internet artist High Smileson. This is a short but relaxing and fun click-read-find game.<br>- Find all the mini-stories on the world map, along the way finding snails in each picture.<br>- Cartoon graphics <br>- Great relaxing music<br>- A hero who will teach you not to worry about the difficulties of life<br>- Easy gameplay!",
